  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN WOMEN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Embassy of Ireland is supporting UN Women / OHCHR to implement a project that seeks to prevent violence against women in elections (VAWE), thereby contributing to greater participation and representation of women in political leadership. Project activities focus on  Strengthening the capacity of rights holders to play a leading role in peacebuilding, Strengthening the capacity of county and sub-county structures that deliver on prevention of VAWE, and Capacitating key institutions to provide oversight in the implementation of early warning systems, including linking the county based VAWE prevention measures to the national level mechanisms.</narrative>
  </description>
